/-!
# Original C.5.1–5 block analysis

The original subgroup hypotheses construct the moved χ₀ block orbit and
its noncommuting conjugate. Baumann normalization and the natural, A₃ and
A₅ module calculations construct the literal setups used by C.5.6. The
local source variants require SQTK only of H, as needed by the simple
ambient C.5.8 application. The full known-simple specialization discharges
the earlier C.1.28 outside-block source input.

Source: Aschbacher–Smith C.5.1–5, printed pp.154–155.
-/
